# NASA API Configuration
# Get a free API key at: https://api.nasa.gov/
# NASA's standard API key quota is typically 1,000 requests per hour.
#
# Keep this key server-side. Do not expose it through NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
# If omitted, the application falls back to NASA's more limited DEMO_KEY.
NASA_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
